// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
//shopkeeper2.c
//专门买书,肉搏书籍,魔法书籍.
#include <ansi.h>;
inherit NPC;
inherit F_VENDOR;

void create()
{
        set_name("弗兰克", ({ "shopman frank","frank"}) );
        set("nickname", "书店老板");
        set("gender", "男性");
        set("age", 25);
        set("long","迷雾堡的书店老板弗兰克.专门贩卖魔法和格斗技巧的书籍\n"
                   "生意一直颇不错\n");

        set("combat_exp", 500000);

        set("str", 30);
        set("int", 30);
        set("cor", 20);
        set("cps", 30);
        set("spi", 30);

      	set_skill("unarmed",60);
      	set_skill("parry",80);
      	set_skill("dodge",80);
      	set_skill("divinemagic",90);

        set_temp("apply/dodge", 100);
        set_temp("apply/armor", 100);

	set("vendor_goods", ([
	"/obj/book/parry_book1":10,
	"/obj/book/magic_book1":10,
	"/obj/book/magic_book2":10,
	__DIR__"obj/u_book1":5,	
	__DIR__"obj/u_book2":5,
	__DIR__"obj/d_book1":5,	
	__DIR__"obj/d_book2":5,	
	__DIR__"obj/p_book1":5,	
	__DIR__"obj/p_book2":5,	
		
	]));

        setup();
        carry_object("/d/miwudao/npc/obj/cloth")->wear();
        add_money("silver",random(50)+1);
}
 

void init()
{
	if(random(10)==1) call_out("greeting",1);
}

int greeting()
{
	command("say 这位客人,我能为您做点什么吗?");	
}